{
  "$comment": "UI texts of the App SDKs (Android, iOS) with their az, en and ru defaults. GET /mobile/config sends the user language's set, with the inbox's own overrides on top (the panel can change greeting_line1, greeting_line1_anonymous, greeting_line2, send_card_title, composer_placeholder, header_subtitle, empty_list, closed and offline); an SDK uses its built-in copy of this file until it has a config. %d stands for a number, %@ for a text. Every language must have the same keys (npm run validate). {name} and {first_name} are the user's name; greeting_line1_anonymous is shown when there is none. header_subtitle, under the name in the conversation's header, is the reply time the panel chose unless the panel wrote its own; the default here is the minutes reply time. loading is the accessibility label of the loading indicator. messages_title names the Home card that opens the conversation list and that list; news_title the news; pick_media, pick_camera and pick_file are the attachment sheet's rows and remove_attachment the label of the x on a picked file. There is no tab bar, so tab_home and tab_messages are gone.",
